wire, identity custody or operator account changes.

Classification and disposition:
- socket_request_flood_replays_exact_output_and_delivers_exit_to_logic: B1/B3
  fixture waits rewritten; B2 real socket proof moved to explicit night command.
- lifecycle three original scenarios: B1/B2; all three bodies retained verbatim
  behind ONE night lifecycle_real_process_boundary entry point. No assertions lost.

Fast coverage:
- supervisor::close_policy_tests::grace_expires_at_sixty_seconds_and_undo_is_refused_at_the_boundary:
  real 60-second policy, one millisecond before vs exact expiry, stale close ID,
  late retry cannot reset deadline, expiry independent of logic.
- supervisor::close_policy_tests::retry_keeps_the_original_deadline_and_undo_cancels_it_once:
  exact retry deadline, conflicting IDs/deadlines, undo cancellation/idempotence.
- registry::close_policy_tests::close_keeps_its_deadline_and_position_across_reopen_and_checks_revisions:
  durable close record, exact Position, layout/generation/revision refusal, same
  generation/session and exact close handle after restoration.
- registry::close_policy_tests::expired_undo_is_refused_and_only_the_exit_receipt_makes_the_seat_retained:
  expired undo, no speculative clock-only retention, exit receipt + reopened record.
- logic::close_restoration_tests::undo_restores_the_exact_position_once_and_refuses_stale_process_handles:
  idempotent restoration reply, liveness and replaced-generation fences.
- logic::pending_tests::pending_notifications_stay_bounded_and_preserve_resize_and_exit_order:
  existing 20,000-event captured backlog, one ready seat, ordered resize/output/Exit.
- logic::pending_tests::raw_backlog_cap_preserves_fifo_while_captured_output_coalesces_until_exit:
  1,024 raw cap, typed refusal, raw FIFO untouched, 10,000 captured events coalesce,
  final output and exit delivered in order.

